"1rti6e35btc": "The automatic lawn sprinklers run from 04:15 to 04:25 on a timer in the park office. Bins 5, 6, 8 and 9 are inside the sprinkler area; east gate Bins 1, 2 and 3 are outside it. The water gets into the wire-mesh bins.",
