"1y10x0fvvl7": "※ Since last year, please do not use black bags. Please use translucent bags you can see into. — Sanitation Office",
"7glz22106h": "The burnable garbage truck comes in from the 2-chome side and passes the park's east gate collection point at around 08:10. Before that, the park cleaner empties the park bins once.",
"shff1pjoka": "警視庁 科学捜査研究所 · 鑑定書 (translation)",
"vj4gz4y42d": "October 18, 1994 · Physics Section",
"1gj0uvgg2wb": "Expert Report — Bags · Knots · Items Left Behind",
"10yuib4klib": "One row (eight bags) of the 21 bags laid out for analysis. The number tags show the bin and the order in which they were found.",
"1n3q0qa6t8m": "One row (eight bags) of the 21 bags laid out for analysis. The number tags show the bin and the order in which they were found. Photographed unopened, before the parts were sent to the Department of Forensic Medicine. In one, a palm is pressed flat against the plastic so that all five fingers show through; in another, the sole of a foot shows through, down to the toes. In every bag, light-brown water with a faint reddish tinge has pooled at the bottom.",
"188c9v4worp": "45 L translucent (milky) polyethylene, 0.03 mm thick. All 21 carry the same lot number embossed in the bottom seam, [[KT-9409-17|k_lot]] — believed to come from the same box",
"fr84soe5in": "[[Knot|k_knot]]",
"1jcjtwqbq2z": "All 21 tied with the same knot. Neck twisted once, wound twice, end pulled through as a loop. All wound to the left",
"1al4wgc9nsn": "Tape",
"gn5dmyhapb": "One bag from Bin 6: a 12 cm tear in the side patched with 48 mm-wide clear packing tape. One [[receipt|k_receipt]] stuck under the tape along with it",
"10pij1p3fez": "[[Sunrise Mart|k_sunrise]], Kashiwadai Station branch · October 14, 04:31 · 1 packing tape, 1 canned coffee · ¥504 (incl. 3% tax)",
"2epo4bhcebe": "Bin 3",
"yu8dmn7ado": "One empty can of coffee on top of the 2 bags (same product as on the receipt). Nothing on top of the can",
"i1ef2pyho4": "Bloodstains on outer surface",
"mkfaa03cg7": "Palm-sized dried bloodstains on the outside of several bags — not leakage from inside but transfer stains from outside. Human blood, type B",
"12lh7nxhusb": "No usable fingerprints on bags or tape (rubber glove marks)",
