"10np3ipqsfc": "Residual chlorine",
"19nm52uh9ov": "None — not tap water",
"1v2poxh0jdu": "Blood components",
"vag5widp8u": "Present, diluted (human, type B)",
"o8tp8o3fs1": "Item",
"p6p9gye57o": "This composition matches the characteristics of the blackish-brown hot-spring water that comes from deep underground strata in southern Tokyo, known as [[black water|k_kuroyu]] (黒湯). The body is believed to have been washed for a long time not in tap water but in water of this kind.",
"1ye8crxzkb3": "Within Asagi Ward, the places that pump up well water like this are mostly bathhouses — check of the public health center's hot-spring use permit register requested.",
"1st669myqov": "Examiner: Ueno, technical officer",
"1a7mz732m4b": "Delivered to the investigation HQ October 17 · postmarked Asagi · no sender",
"1d49toqc5ox": "Anonymous Tip-Off Letter",
"1e5dv1bf1mx": "Original in ballpoint pen. (Translated into English.)",
"nd38gsnfeb": "To the Special Investigation Headquarters.",
"1na3s46fzft": "Look into [[Kimura Butcher Shop|k_kimura]], west of the park. Every night you can hear a saw running inside the shop. And they always put out mountains of garbage bags.",
"onyr9uv9ka": "A man who cuts meat bone and all could do a thing like that.",
"1jrqpmrb40r": "— A neighbor",
"2drqae15mlz": "October 16, 1994 · Corpo Sakura No. 203, Midori-cho",
"1u8x7eqgxis": "Search Record — Saeki Junji's Apartment",
"jkvozskejl": "A one-room apartment; he lived alone. No sign of anyone coming or going since the 12th. Mail from the 13th to the 15th still in the mailbox.",
"btjac5k005": "The work word processor and four floppy disks on the desk. The other three were in the drawer.",
"xx05msvdbj": "Desk",
"1v6kuhmh4cg": "1 word processor for work · 7 [[floppy disks|k_floppy]] (unlabeled)",
"bxf3gpxl41": "Business cards",
"1ks3sn80bxw": "“Kageno Enterprises, Sales Section Manager, Saeki Junji” · pager no. [[030-58-2147|k_pagerno]] (the pager itself not in the apartment)",
"1ykvde00cpv": "Mailbox",
"249nhkmoxd2": "Overdue notice postcard from the video rental shop “Video Panda” — member no. [[0417-2253|k_videono]]",
"13ywfvunvab": "Calendar",
"bw19keowy2": "Penciled in the October 12 box: “K ○” · in the October 14 box: “Bank 9:00”",
"1kyrrqk15ha": "Other",
"1lybu1b72wm": "3 suits · no briefcase · no car (license only)",
"1cncwfxfcvo": "Place",
"1ei19ycb4ex": "Items checked / seized",
"12o9oa3snyj": "The pager, the briefcase and the seal case turned up neither in the apartment nor with the body. Who or where the “K” on the calendar is remains unknown.",
"9ftff18k0u": "Search supervised by Assistant Inspector Sasaki",
"1gcqxcn9af": "October 17, 1994 · Witness: [[Noda Keiko|k_noda]] (28) · office clerk, Kageno Enterprises",
"kn62mkmzpo": "Statement — Office Clerk, Kageno Enterprises",
"1gtl4unukhu": "On the afternoon of the 11th the boss and Mr. Saeki had a big fight. About Mr. Saeki pocketing a deposit on the side. The boss threw an ashtray. You'd have heard it outside the office.",
"2a4w24hmwuy": "Noda",
"1bcznzim59a": "Mr. Saeki handled the bathhouse in 2-chome all on his own. He didn't even show the papers to [[Mr. Murakoshi|k_murakoshi]], the boss. He went there on the night of [[September 28|k_0928]] too, and when he came in the next morning he said, “The old lady collapsed.”",
"tufb1j4c06": "Mr. Saeki put a password on every one of his word-processor documents. Always the last four digits of his own pager number. We used to laugh about why he even bothered.",
"ic9v7cumjv": "On the 13th the boss paged Mr. Saeki all day long. In the evening he went out saying he'd “write it on the [[message board|k_dengon]] at Kashiwadai Station, then.”",
"1uomp1qxg6f": "The boss only smokes [[foreign cigarettes|k_cig]]. The ones with the gold band.",
"ti0vomsq6l": "Because the company's going under. Everyone kept saying that if we bought just that one last lot, the bank would bail us out.",
"w6r1b7flr4": "Witness: Noda Keiko (signature)",
"akwxlyqp2e": "October 19, 1994 · Sakai (41), station staff, Kashiwadai Station",
"162lcbxmjdx": "Witness Statement — Kashiwadai Station Message Board",
"1o0f5vwgwef": "The message board beside the ticket gates (photographed October 19). Wiped clean and filled up again every day.",
"acr5j1jfsj": "The message board is the blackboard beside the ticket gates. We wipe it all off on the 10 p.m. patrol.",
"274iv1fmbkf": "Around 7:40 on the evening of the 13th, a man in his late forties in a suit pressed the chalk down hard and wrote “Saeki — call me right now. Murakoshi.” The writing was so big it took up half the board. After that he spent a long time making calls from the payphones in front of the ticket gates, then went out toward the park.",
"ctrx5aww9t": "There are four payphones in front of the ticket gates. We pull the station shutters down at 12:30 a.m., when the last train's gone.",
