"egst0hhoks": "Hayama Koichi hereby acknowledges having borrowed the sum of ¥18,000,000 from Kageno Enterprises Co., Ltd. Should he fail to repay it within the term, he shall repay it with the land and building ([[Kashiwa-yu|k_kashiwayu]]) at No. ○, Kashiwadai 2-chome, Asagi Ward.",
