"13kvktw3wn": "Scene Inspection Record — Kashiwa-yu Washing Area",
"119fxkoe8pp": "Around the washing-area drain. The yellow number tags mark spots where bloodstains were confirmed.",
"16y93ivnfx2": "Wall beside the boiler room door",
"clpfpybv6v": "Dozens of spatter spots 1–3 mm across, 40–70 cm above the floor. Tails point upward — where something low down was struck hard with an object",
"2b4lg9lf9ud": "Boiler room → washing area",
"27kxlve00m9": "Round drip stains 5–8 mm across in a single line — someone walking slowly, carrying something that dripped blood",
"1hd4by2i8if": "Washing-area tiles",
"1a2ok09tcle": "Traces of wiping in wide arcs. Every grout line strongly luminol-positive",
"28oxmgsq1vs": "Drain trap",
"6fj9afh46g": "Taken apart: human blood in the sediment, ABO type B. Fine bone dust mixed in",
"ppmzgmp9qj": "Cargo bike crate",
"2cmt0zc1r6s": "Transfer stains in the gaps between the floorboards — human blood, type B",
"1cppkfkbpuw": "Dozens of spatter spots 1–3 mm across, 40–70 cm above the floor. Spread in a fan, tails pointing upward — where something low down was struck hard with an object. When luminol was sprayed in the dark, the spots all surfaced at once, and the foot of the wall beside the door turned blotchy blue",
"1520rzj3bgk": "Round drip stains 5–8 mm across in a single line. Drops with even edges run unbroken over the sill to the middle of the washing area — someone walking slowly, carrying something that dripped blood",
"n42wr6k5bz": "Traces of wiping in wide arcs. Arm-length arcs laid over one another again and again. Every grout line strongly luminol-positive",
"1ta106ihshl": "Taken apart: a thick layer of dark red sediment has settled inside the bend of the pipe. Human blood in the sediment, ABO type B. Tangled hair, lumps of hardened grease and fine bone dust mixed in",
"j5p9f169gi": "Transfer stains in the gaps between the floorboards — a few dark red, dried stains left on top of signs of rinsing with water. When the gaps were picked at with the point of a knife, hardened blood crumbled out with the wood grain. Human blood, type B",
"j219kn9s6l": "Findings",
"50bypmdde": "The wall beside the boiler-room door, and the floor. Photographed during the examination.",
"1r093ubs75g": "The dismantled drain trap. Human blood and fine bone dust were found in the sediment.",
"rc23gcbayu": "The dismantled drain trap. Inside the bend of the pipe, a thick layer of dark red, mud-like sludge has settled, mixed with tangled hair and lumps of yellowed, hardened grease. Human blood and fine bone dust were found in the sediment. Rubbed between gloved fingertips, the bone dust grates like sand.",
"24k8hczbg2v": "Most of the bloodstains in the washing area had been wiped and washed away, but what soaked into the grout and the drain trap remained. Washing this much blood off this floor would take hours of running a lot of water.",
"18tbszlcci": "Most of the bloodstains in the washing area had been wiped and washed away, but what soaked into the grout and the drain trap remained. Scrape the grout and the top 1 mm is bleached white, but beneath that it is stained dark red, like rusted iron. Washing this much blood off this floor would take hours of running a lot of water.",
"168pd0aqsrt": "Blood type B. DNA typing (MCT118 method) requested from the National Research Institute of Police Science — about 4 weeks for a reply.",
"17h0e3v8aya": "※ Attending forensics officer: every tile reeked of bleach. Each time the grout was scraped, black powder fell.",
"2g1g7ob7r0o": "※ Attending forensics officer: every tile reeked of bleach. From the drain, beneath that, rose a sickly-sweet smell of rot that got through even two layers of masks. Each time the grout was scraped, black powder fell. When the trap's screws were loosened, the standing water gushed out and the stench of rotten meat hit all at once; one of the attending officers ran out of the washing area and threw up.",
"1nff664zf1x": "Forensics Section · Assistant Inspector Nishida",
